"entity": {
"name": "Venture Global, Inc.",
"description": "Venture Global, Inc. engages in the provision of United States liquefied natural gas sourced from resource rich North American natural gas basins. It operates through the following segments: Calcasieu Project, Plaquemines Project, CP2 Project, and Sales and shipping. The company was founded by Michael Sabel and Robert Pender in 2023 and is headquartered in Arlington, VA.",
